OL,4,GUS ANNOUNCES NEW TARIFF PROPOSALS ON   
OL,5,GEU, CHINA, AND OTHER TRADE PARTNERS:   
OL,6,FDifferent tariffs will apply to        
OL,7,Fdifferent countries and products.      
OL,8,FChina is facing the highest rate of    
OL,9,F"up to 40%" - although the effective   
OL,10,Frate could be lower.          CSee P131
OL,12,GBURNHAM AND BADENOCH CLASH AT PMQS     
OL,13,GOVER UNIVERSITY FEES FOR EU STUDENTS   
OL,14,GIN UK:                                 
OL,15,FThe government agreed a new deal with  
OL,16,Fthe EU on youth mobility, food exports 
OL,17,Fand emissions trading at a summit last 
OL,18,Fweek.                         CSee P132
