OL,4,GUS ARMY TO CARRY OUT CONTROLLED BLAST  
OL,5,GOF DEGRADED EXPLOSIVES IN IOWA:        
OL,6,FAn appeals court overturned a decision 
OL,7,Fto stop 68 barrels of lead azide being 
OL,8,Fdetonated; the Army said it was        
OL,9,Fnecessary to protect against an        
OL,10,Funplanned explosion.          CSee P133
